Package: namazu-elements
Version: @@VERSION@@
Architecture: all
Section: java
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Namazu Studios <engineering@namazustudios.com>
Homepage: https://namazustudios.com
Depends: default-jre-headless | java21-runtime-headless, systemd, systemd-sysusers
Recommends: ca-certificates
Description: Namazu Elements game backend
 The open-source backend server for connected games: REST APIs, WebSocket
 endpoints, realtime multiplayer, a content CDN, and the plugin ("Element")
 system. This package runs the Jetty-based server as the
 namazu-elements.service systemd unit under a dedicated elements user, with
 configuration in /etc/elements and state in /var/lib/namazu-elements.
